<main class="calm-main calm-page">

    <section class="calm-interior-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <p class="calm-section-eyebrow">CALM Zoo</p>
            <h1 class="calm-page-title">Visitor Guidelines</h1>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="calm-interior-content-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="calm-content-shell">
                <article class="calm-content-card">
                    <div class="calm-wp-content">
                        <div class="calm-history-intro">
<p class="calm-section-eyebrow">Visitor Guidelines</p>
<h2>Help keep CALM Zoo safe, welcoming, and enjoyable for everyone.</h2>
<p>
        CALM Zoo is home to native California animals, plants, and habitats. These guidelines help protect<br />
        guests, staff, volunteers, and the animals in our care.
    </p>
</div>
<div class="calm-info-grid">
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Respect the Animals</h3>
<p>Please do not feed, touch, tease, tap on glass, throw objects, or disturb the animals. Many animals at CALM Zoo are non-releasable wildlife and require a calm, safe environment.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Stay on Paths</h3>
<p>For your safety and the protection of habitats, please remain on designated guest paths and follow all posted signs.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Supervise Children</h3>
<p>Children must be supervised at all times. Please help younger guests enjoy the zoo respectfully and safely.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Outside Food</h3>
<p>Guests are welcome to bring a picnic and enjoy the zoo grounds. Alcohol is prohibited.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Water &amp; Weather</h3>
<p>CALM Zoo is primarily outdoors. Comfortable shoes, sun protection, weather-appropriate clothing, and refillable water bottles are recommended.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Pets &amp; Service Animals</h3>
<p>Pets are not permitted inside CALM Zoo. Service animals are allowed in accordance with applicable guidelines.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Smoking &amp; Vaping</h3>
<p>Smoking and vaping are not permitted inside zoo grounds.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Photography</h3>
<p>Guest photography is welcome. Please be respectful of other visitors and do not cross barriers or disturb animals for photos.</p>
</p></div>
<div class="calm-info-card">
<h3>Accessibility</h3>
<p>CALM Zoo works to provide a welcoming experience for all guests. Strollers and wheelchairs may be available to rent on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>
</p></div>
</div>
<div class="calm-callout">
<h3>Questions before your visit?</h3>
<p>
        Contact CALM Zoo at <a href="tel:6615468940">661-546-8940</a> for current visitor information,<br />
        accessibility questions, or guest services support.
    </p>
</div>
<div class="calm-button-row">
    <a class="calm-content-btn" href="/visit/">Plan Your Visit</a><br />
    <a class="calm-content-btn calm-content-btn-outline" href="/faq/">View FAQ</a>
</div>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>


